Appendix C: Comparative Case Study Protocol

C.1 Case Selection

C.1.1 Inclusion Criteria

Cases were selected to maximize variation on two dimensions:

1. Sovereignty level: Private (certification by non-state actors) vs. sovereign (certification by state actors)
2. Success: Successful certification regimes vs. failed certification regimes

