F.5 Validation Rules

1. Completeness: All required fields must be present
2. Consistency: Measurements must reference valid sensors
3. Plausibility: Values must be within physical ranges
4. Timeliness: Timestamps must be monotonically increasing
5. Traceability: Events must reference valid components

